<https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#DataElementConceptBoundShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A DataElementSpecification must RESOLVE its ambiguity: either BIND (cr:boundConcept + cr:declaredUnitConcept as a UCUM IRI) or be EXPLICITLY declared unbound (cr:unboundRationale). A prose-only element that does neither is non-conformant — bind, don't describe." .
