_:cb11a0ced0b1817018b2c024fd9cf89cf2f2ecde9b25a2a398ab16361cc967cfaab <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Warning: publication cites no endpoint result (cr:disclosesResult) — fine for a design/methods paper, a trace hole for a results paper." .
_:cb11a0ced0b1817018b2c024fd9cf89cf2f2ecde9b25a2a398ab16361cc967cfaab <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/shapes/disclosure-v1> .
_:cb11a0ced0b1817018b2c024fd9cf89cf2f2ecde9b25a2a398ab16361cc967cfaab <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this cr:disclosesResult ?r }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb11a0ced0b1817018b2c024fd9cf89cf2f2ecde9b25a2a398ab16361cc967cfaab <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
_:cb11a6dfbf633d422b829d09d0a65a6cabb97e6bd4bebdb2b74f8b60b499e631df9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "cx:Mapping has cx:inferredBy (LLM-produced) but cx:confirmedBy is absent. Human curation is required before promotion to verified." .
_:cb11a6dfbf633d422b829d09d0a65a6cabb97e6bd4bebdb2b74f8b60b499e631df9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this <https://top.scientix.ai/crosswalk/v1#inferredBy> ?agent .\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this <https://top.scientix.ai/crosswalk/v1#confirmedBy> ?curator . }\n            }\n        " .
