_:cb172c1aef25a2c9c5c00053ab5015ec0f9493e2a8a7b6eae90c06b0751474b051b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An eCTDSubmission carries a CSR but not the analysis datasets (cr:includesDataset) and/or the Define-XML (cr:includesDefine). Module 5 datasets should ship with the report a reviewer reads them against." .
_:cb172c1aef25a2c9c5c00053ab5015ec0f9493e2a8a7b6eae90c06b0751474b051b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this a cr:eCTDSubmission .\n              FILTER ( NOT EXISTS { $this cr:includesDataset ?d }\n                       || NOT EXISTS { $this cr:includesDefine ?x } )\n            }\n        " .
_:cb172c1aef25a2c9c5c00053ab5015ec0f9493e2a8a7b6eae90c06b0751474b051b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
