_:cb1736ae1416c9c0f87d07050b3cacae9ffcb1a853e6c0348bd4cacf254750b3164 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A breach must be dispositioned 'systemic' or 'isolated' — the escalation path depends on it." .
_:cb1736ae1416c9c0f87d07050b3cacae9ffcb1a853e6c0348bd4cacf254750b3164 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
