_:cb184abb35c25ff2c0bde27abcdd8ff1100776487ad69296099f5d6d25541dff04e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "NotPHI" .
_:cb184abb35c25ff2c0bde27abcdd8ff1100776487ad69296099f5d6d25541dff04e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cbeebc59a3488225699edb73e4345861f5252e4add0a0516d74f32c4eb58b9d761 .
_:cb1855ea02bea5d08fabba4cce973bca1d012cca7dc2940793e19c8d28acb439a33 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "An eCTDSubmission is built on a database lock that is not a HARD lock. Reversible (soft-locked) data cannot ground a regulatory filing." .
_:cb1855ea02bea5d08fabba4cce973bca1d012cca7dc2940793e19c8d28acb439a33 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this a cr:eCTDSubmission ; cr:builtOnLock ?lk .\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?lk cr:lockType \"hard\" }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb18658ced976334f71e5903b8b04ca1b84d46d064f10be51f07054d7e81975f409 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Warning: autocoded assignment has no human cr:CodingReview — the autocoder's output is a suggestion, not a judgment, until a coder reviews it." .
_:cb18658ced976334f71e5903b8b04ca1b84d46d064f10be51f07054d7e81975f409 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/shapes/coding-v1> .
_:cb18658ced976334f71e5903b8b04ca1b84d46d064f10be51f07054d7e81975f409 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n                $this cr:codingMethod \"autocoder\" .\n                FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?r cr:reviewsAssignment $this }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb18658ced976334f71e5903b8b04ca1b84d46d064f10be51f07054d7e81975f409 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
_:cb186fcd3ddd34c0443d31581ed79fbec766eca98d0810b9e55b9b38a79b0bf3670 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "medium" .
_:cb186fcd3ddd34c0443d31581ed79fbec766eca98d0810b9e55b9b38a79b0bf3670 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cb17901c167d54e917e3d460816ae0c237b715aa910b01a55b123e71a447a2c078a .
_:cb187edc77cc4b29e1cff0975bedc164cd8ccff2e2b8d8c44939b1dc417e4314b04 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://top.scientix.ai/hcls/v1#Person> .
_:cb187edc77cc4b29e1cff0975bedc164cd8ccff2e2b8d8c44939b1dc417e4314b04 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Enrollment must reference the real Person (PII bridge)." .
_:cb187edc77cc4b29e1cff0975bedc164cd8ccff2e2b8d8c44939b1dc417e4314b04 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb187edc77cc4b29e1cff0975bedc164cd8ccff2e2b8d8c44939b1dc417e4314b04 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#enrolledPerson> .
_:cb187f3e35efcb64d43214bbe36b44811a180729d03720002a4115fb16a65956071 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "derived" .
_:cb187f3e35efcb64d43214bbe36b44811a180729d03720002a4115fb16a65956071 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:cb188a8fed75f027f206969600dc4cab5ad3879eaa85216055eaa54042ce789f862 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "Dataset-JSON" .
_:cb188a8fed75f027f206969600dc4cab5ad3879eaa85216055eaa54042ce789f862 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cbbf8b8005ea2cf6b6e7015824ebfeca66fbd31dd7e23a1afb6a4b006a7cc7d652 .
_:cb188d48e57bfe26f7010f1b1944a2ab89a213eeb4d2a64feae8e3c004fdb5c505e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:cb137efb17f22743a2c8b2e816a824593edd2a41c8b24cc7d0d82fd5e7b20ef36fa .
_:cb188d48e57bfe26f7010f1b1944a2ab89a213eeb4d2a64feae8e3c004fdb5c505e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Detectability, when stated, is 'low'|'medium'|'high'." .
_:cb188d48e57bfe26f7010f1b1944a2ab89a213eeb4d2a64feae8e3c004fdb5c505e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#detectability> .
_:cb18a6a787757b1eca5ce43617b973399606f032e107e8462c6ee17b748ce0a329b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A DataTransferAgreement references a legal document but does not pin it by content hash (cr:documentHash). The binding legal contract stays prose/DocuSign; the DTA references it by URI + hash + version so the reference cannot silently drift." .
_:cb18a6a787757b1eca5ce43617b973399606f032e107e8462c6ee17b748ce0a329b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#> .
_:cb18a6a787757b1eca5ce43617b973399606f032e107e8462c6ee17b748ce0a329b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this cr:referencesLegalDocument ?doc .\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this cr:documentHash ?h }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb18aabf10c816f6f370ad9917ddd48468d14e4b99ca855846a99344d1c6fafb40b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "T3: Submission-ready AE must carry BOTH cr:meddraLowestLevelTerm (LLT) and cr:meddraPreferredTerm (PT). This AE is submission-ready (it is codesEntity of a CodeAssignment AND appears in a derivation chain to an AnalysisDataset or reportsEvent of a SafetyReport)." .
_:cb18aabf10c816f6f370ad9917ddd48468d14e4b99ca855846a99344d1c6fafb40b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/shapes/traceability-v1> .
_:cb18aabf10c816f6f370ad9917ddd48468d14e4b99ca855846a99344d1c6fafb40b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            PREFIX prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              # This AE has been coded\n              ?assignment a cr:CodeAssignment ;\n                          cr:codesEntity $this .\n              \n              # AND it appears in submission artifacts\n              {\n                # Either: an AnalysisDataset derives from it\n                ?adae a cr:AnalysisDataset ;\n                      prov:wasDerivedFrom+ $this .\n              } UNION {\n                # Or: a SafetyReport reports it\n                ?report a cr:SafetyReport ;\n                        cr:reportsEvent $this .\n              }\n              \n              # But it lacks LLT or PT\n              {\n                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this cr:meddraLowestLevelTerm ?llt }\n              } UNION {\n                FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this cr:meddraPreferredTerm ?pt }\n              }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb18ec1eec16503925f1188071695e25d43b19308d3fddaf3ced959ae8487413c87 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "low" .
_:cb18ec1eec16503925f1188071695e25d43b19308d3fddaf3ced959ae8487413c87 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cb1aee2a2318c8c85f99c837733f2af1de8b32a06a7acaf92de54ec1bbd897e156b .
_:cb18f51c5dd0a64f622da98e1252d0bf55f42b7131ffac3983b66d5a67728631169 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/LogicalReasoning> .
_:cb18f51c5dd0a64f622da98e1252d0bf55f42b7131ffac3983b66d5a67728631169 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:cb190796d27bbeb8233161905ce7a8e58c6812c8db526f85d90bcbcb08b1de68b2e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "administrative" .
_:cb190796d27bbeb8233161905ce7a8e58c6812c8db526f85d90bcbcb08b1de68b2e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:cb19089ec4653b46804f6e38d9416af3afe76c64a1c4d37e22b27561ca633393151 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "Received" .
_:cb19089ec4653b46804f6e38d9416af3afe76c64a1c4d37e22b27561ca633393151 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cb194275ac27f2fdad98db1e3ad287bbff75045db28d58a36dfc0a5362667cf2ee8 .
