_:cb1ac4dc39d5fac31ecad83b4d4b92e50d045b6675b0fec6d97fc45ea63d7871fa7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb1ac4dc39d5fac31ecad83b4d4b92e50d045b6675b0fec6d97fc45ea63d7871fa7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#reviewVerdict> .
