_:cb1ad4e39c202e6242eb7a75a31a587de83ae0f8f1701ac061ffe757f0ddfd7efd7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:cb16a4c228b8e8cee6a5dc1b25129170d42c4b010eab2937abd92ac5b12dd866d35 .
_:cb1aedfb27d625c6893c011a70e2f84650a5aefa543b1552639bb75e7826fc2a453 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#CloseOutVisit> .
_:cb1aedfb27d625c6893c011a70e2f84650a5aefa543b1552639bb75e7826fc2a453 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Violation: site closure without a Close-Out Visit — a site is closed by evidence, not declaration." .
_:cb1aedfb27d625c6893c011a70e2f84650a5aefa543b1552639bb75e7826fc2a453 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
