_:cb1c63404da48fbe2bf911f96dfe28605618fecd09f6dfccf87164d5656ebc39e0b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A limit breach must rest on at least one metric observation — no evidence, no breach." .
_:cb1c63404da48fbe2bf911f96dfe28605618fecd09f6dfccf87164d5656ebc39e0b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
