_:cb1c777141f9aeb37bebff18e2a274002fbcfd38d0eef81ad11228e863f2bf21109 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb1c777141f9aeb37bebff18e2a274002fbcfd38d0eef81ad11228e863f2bf21109 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#excursionOnLot> .
