_:cb2224093e2b1e9b644d402245b8359acc621090195bb235cc86814e792be2c21b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "TransferProfile.transmissionType is mandatory and must be 'cumulative' or 'incremental'." .
_:cb2224093e2b1e9b644d402245b8359acc621090195bb235cc86814e792be2c21b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
