_:cb230ba48ad015921c82195d620ee306bdbb265119649a8f6253b682c53c5a83f45 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A transferred lab result carries specimen-lifecycle timestamps but its hcls:Specimen has no cr:CustodyEvent chain. The timestamps are a convenience view over the authoritative chain of custody (provenance, not a Biomedical Concept), which must exist." .
_:cb230ba48ad015921c82195d620ee306bdbb265119649a8f6253b682c53c5a83f45 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              $this cr:onSpecimen ?spec .\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?ce a cr:CustodyEvent ; cr:specimen ?spec }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb2310e0394f0305e1834c9db2daa79f98e6b1876903e23125fbf99d09854e05640 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "cr:DataProcessingAgreement must link to a processor organization via cr:processorOrg." .
_:cb2310e0394f0305e1834c9db2daa79f98e6b1876903e23125fbf99d09854e05640 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
