_:cb23749afec7b75b9f0b1823980b19319e3b942bcd756bd12f4beab397835fdfa4f <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Delegation must name the delegate." .
_:cb23749afec7b75b9f0b1823980b19319e3b942bcd756bd12f4beab397835fdfa4f <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
