_:cb238de56db9126808e105f5a4fca6291abc6590fa29a5b66abfa3253c6bbfef48a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
_:cb238de56db9126808e105f5a4fca6291abc6590fa29a5b66abfa3253c6bbfef48a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb238de56db9126808e105f5a4fca6291abc6590fa29a5b66abfa3253c6bbfef48a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Universal DNA: every entity must carry exactly one top:observedAt (xsd:dateTime)." .
_:cb238de56db9126808e105f5a4fca6291abc6590fa29a5b66abfa3253c6bbfef48a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb238de56db9126808e105f5a4fca6291abc6590fa29a5b66abfa3253c6bbfef48a <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#observedAt> .
_:cb239de394eaac95994620f7414895c68f8e7ca076016ca6cb8df00757e9000b4d6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLTarget> .
_:cb239de394eaac95994620f7414895c68f8e7ca076016ca6cb8df00757e9000b4d6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/shapes/coding-v1> .
_:cb239de394eaac95994620f7414895c68f8e7ca076016ca6cb8df00757e9000b4d6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX cr: <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#>\n            PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\n            SELECT ?this WHERE {\n              ?this rdf:type ?t .\n              FILTER ( ?t IN ( cr:CodeAssignment, cr:CausalityAssessment, \n                               cr:ExpectednessAssessment, cr:CodingReview ) )\n            }\n        " .
_:cb23b01bcdbefa72be7e2c9132311a0a3720e2ac8c59b06766688bd4987462b658b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "A KRI must carry an action threshold (the boundary at which intervention is mandatory)." .
_:cb23b01bcdbefa72be7e2c9132311a0a3720e2ac8c59b06766688bd4987462b658b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb23b01bcdbefa72be7e2c9132311a0a3720e2ac8c59b06766688bd4987462b658b <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#actionThreshold> .
_:cb23ccad76116bf9f04278125ad7dda9f115f2c75502612e73ab951b9e5b6aef94e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "T2: External alignment must be a fully-provenanced cx:Mapping, not a bare SKOS triple on a clinical object. Found skos:exactMatch, skos:closeMatch, skos:relatedMatch, skos:broadMatch, or skos:narrowMatch directly on $this." .
_:cb23ccad76116bf9f04278125ad7dda9f115f2c75502612e73ab951b9e5b6aef94e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://top.scientix.ai/shapes/traceability-v1> .
_:cb23ccad76116bf9f04278125ad7dda9f115f2c75502612e73ab951b9e5b6aef94e <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n            PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>\n            PREFIX cx: <https://top.scientix.ai/crosswalk/v1#>\n            PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n              # $this has at least one SKOS match predicate (guaranteed by targetSubjectsOf)\n              {\n                $this skos:exactMatch ?x .\n              } UNION {\n                $this skos:closeMatch ?x .\n              } UNION {\n                $this skos:relatedMatch ?x .\n              } UNION {\n                $this skos:broadMatch ?x .\n              } UNION {\n                $this skos:narrowMatch ?x .\n              }\n              \n              # Exclude cx:Mapping instances (they may legitimately use SKOS predicates as cx:predicateId)\n              FILTER NOT EXISTS { $this rdf:type cx:Mapping }\n            }\n        " .
_:cb23cf6980fa77a0dc6ce1a80975d85838dc4337a04e1c4f5145b082313d0154f49 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#StudySubject> .
