_:cb23cf6980fa77a0dc6ce1a80975d85838dc4337a04e1c4f5145b082313d0154f49 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:cb23cf6980fa77a0dc6ce1a80975d85838dc4337a04e1c4f5145b082313d0154f49 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://top.scientix.ai/cr/v1#forSubject> .
